OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fbut mostly dry on Monday, before a
OL,7,Fband of rain moves through on Tuesday,
OL,8,Fsunny spells and scattered showers on
OL,9,FWednesday. Temperatures around average
OL,10,Ffor the time of year.
